1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,191
Your assistant remembers you.

2
00:00:02,241 --> 00:00:04,600
Does it know when it might be wrong?

3
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:06,310
This is CAVEAT.

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:12,507
Every memory carries its source, the strength of its
evidence, its freshness, and its scope.

5
00:00:12,557 --> 00:00:14,325
The household is fictional.

6
00:00:15,075 --> 00:00:18,385
In July, Maya said she wants morning deliveries.

7
00:00:18,435 --> 00:00:22,375
Since then, the courier has logged
three failed mornings.

8
00:00:22,425 --> 00:00:28,675
So before booking the sofa, CAVEAT says it might be
wrong, and the server refuses to book.

9
00:00:29,425 --> 00:00:30,930
She chooses afternoons.

10
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:34,851
That becomes her correction, and
the booking goes through.

11
00:00:34,901 --> 00:00:37,825
A model's guess is shown, but it never wins.

12
00:00:38,575 --> 00:00:45,541
A month later, her office days are a hundred and
thirteen days old, past their ninety-day horizon.

13
00:00:45,591 --> 00:00:46,758
So it asks first.

14
00:00:46,808 --> 00:00:49,550
One tap, and the memory is fresh again.

15
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,922
Now Maya forgets a private appointment.

16
00:00:52,972 --> 00:00:58,471
The evidence, its index entries, and the
booking text that quoted it are deleted.

17
00:00:58,521 --> 00:01:00,800
The receipt lists fourteen checks.

18
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:02,874
Then it proves it.

19
00:01:02,924 --> 00:01:03,638
Ask again.

20
00:01:03,688 --> 00:01:04,172
Reload.

21
00:01:04,222 --> 00:01:04,707
Export.

22
00:01:04,757 --> 00:01:06,463
Restore the old backup.

23
00:01:06,513 --> 00:01:08,143
Release a delayed job.

24
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:09,899
Search the page itself.

25
00:01:09,949 --> 00:01:11,350
Nothing comes back.

26
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:18,775
A naive memory, given the same inputs, books on a
guess, and its forget only hides the row.

27
00:01:19,525 --> 00:01:20,052
CAVEAT.

28
00:01:20,102 --> 00:01:21,866
Remember with reasons.

29
00:01:21,916 --> 00:01:23,350
Forget with proof.
